he brewers enter with the arrival of the season when the flowers dance, and the brewery is filled with the shouts of the brewers. This scene has continued for many years since 1864, when the company was founded.\",\"contacts\":[{\"name\":\"HIDESABURO ENDO\",\"phone\":\"262450117\",\"phone_country_code\":\"+81\",\"email\":\"info@keiryu.jp\",\"_id\":\"6792d1c87ca904179fda4c39\"},{\"name\":\"\",\"phone\":\"\",\"email\":\"\",\"_id\":\"6792d1c87ca904179fda4c3a\"}],\"social\":[],\"brands\":[\"6792d1c87ca904179fda4c3c\"],\"createdAt\":\"2025-01-23T23:33:28.345Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-01-23T23:33:28.345Z\",\"__v\":0,\"slug\":\"endo-brewery-inc\"},\"category\":{\"_id\":\"6939c972a01ad75ff2cc7879\",\"name\":\"Junmai_ginjo\",\"description\":\"GG\",\"force\":23},\"session\":{\"_id\":\"6939c972a01ad75ff2cc788d\",\"name\":\"Tasting Nihonshu\",\"product_type\":\"Sake\"},\"section\":\"\",\"number\":1105,\"status\":\"approved\",\"is_completed\":\"2026-06-22T12:15:07.818Z\",\"was_qr_code_downloaded\":true,\"is_design_bonus\":false,\"current_votes\":8,\"max_votes\":8,\"medals\":[],\"createdAt\":\"2026-02-04T00:28:56.122Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-22T12:15:07.812Z\",\"__v\":9,\"current_judges\":[],\"table\":{\"_id\":\"6a32e6593e734e3aa32500e4\",\"competition\":\"69394e2c7ad96d9433c9a373\",\"name\":\"GG-4\",\"bottle_capacity\":25,\"judge_capacity\":14,\"current_judges\":0,\"__v\":0},\"is_present\":\"2026-06-21T08:19:10.270Z\"},{\"extra_competition_data\":{\"type\":\"Sake\",\"competition_category\":\"6939c972a01ad75ff2cc7879\",\"product_type_detail\":\"\",\"finishing\":[],\"price\":1800,\"currency\":\"JPY\",\"no_sale_price\":false,\"price_not_disclosed\":false,\"jan_code\":\"4935717285616\",\"has_no_jan_code\":false,\"jan_code_not_reveal\":false,\"polishing_rate\":59,\"sake_meter_value\":-12,\"sake_alcohol_level\":13.9,\"nature_of_bubble\":\"\",\"aging_temperature\":\"\",\"special_production_method\":[],\"sake_koji\":[\"yellow\"],\"liqueur_alcohol_type\":\"\",\"liqueur_other_ingredient\"