 brewing technique was demonstrated by winning a Gold Award at Japan's National New Sake Appraisal in 2024, affirming the superior quality of Kunpeki sake. Through participation in the Milano Sake Challenge, Thermoline aims to introduce Kunpeki's delicate flavors to Italy's sophisticated palate, fostering cultural exchange and deepening appreciation through Japan's beloved beverage.\\n\\n\",\"contacts\":[{\"name\":\"Katsuya Inoue\",\"role\":\"Owner\",\"phone\":\"+819042472875\",\"email\":\"keith_inoue@thermoline.jp\",\"_id\":\"69e1553e4078527678e536bd\"}],\"social\":[],\"brands\":[\"67ea295b384e785433990b50\"],\"createdAt\":\"2025-03-24T22:18:00.261Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-16T21:31:42.408Z\",\"__v\":0,\"slug\":\"thermoline-coltd\",\"foundation_year\":2016},\"type\":\"Sake\",\"eng_name\":\"Kunpeki Tokubetsu Jyunmaishu\",\"slug\":\"kunpeki-tokubetsu-jyunmaishu\",\"force\":0,\"images\":[\"https://storage.googleapis.com/compify-bucket-prod/SAKE/products/69d4d3bb36e26c484f14da82/images/1776376150534_8645eth2eb3_ç¹å¥ç´ç±³éR.png\"],\"imageThumbnails\":[\"https://storage.googleapis.com/compify-bucket-prod/SAKE/products/69d4d3bb36e26c484f14da82/images/1776376150534_8645eth2eb3_ç¹å¥ç´ç±³éR-s.png\"],\"made_by\":\"producer\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-07T09:51:55.129Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-16T21:49:10.724Z\",\"__v\":0,\"sake\":{\"_id\":\"69d4d3bb36e26c484f14da84\",\"user\":\"67e1a7282abe09b4d84997c8\",\"product\":\"69d4d3bb36e26c484f14da82\",\"awards\":[],\"eng_name\":\"Kunpeki Tokubetsu Jyunmaishu\",\"original_name\":\"\",\"finishing\":[],\"logistical_info\":[],\"aroma_profile\":[],\"taste_profile\":[],\"food_pairing\":[],\"sake_kakemai\":[],\"sake_kobo\":[],\"sake_kojimai\":[],\"sake_type\":[],\"sake_first_ingredient\":[],\"sake_second_ingredient\":[],\"sake_third_ingredient\":[],\"sake_other_ingredient\":[],\"labels\":[],\"createdAt\":\"2026-04-07T09:51:55.162Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-04-16T21:49:09.286Z\",\"__v\":0},\"original_name\":\"\"},\"company\":{\"addres