r, at the beginning of the Showa era, they moved the business to Higashi-Murayama City in west Tokyo. Our premium sake, Kinkon (Golden Wedding Anniversary in English), has been awarded numerous gold prizes at the Annual Japan Sake Awards, and is used as the sacred sake at the famous Meiji Jingu Shrine as well as Kanda Myojin Shrine.\",\"contacts\":[{\"name\":\"Toshiyuki YOSHIMURA\",\"role\":\"CEO\",\"phone\":\"+81332939111\",\"email\":\"yoshimura-toshiyuki@toshimaya.co.jp\",\"_id\":\"679341ddc3b340b981aed812\"}],\"social\":[{\"name\":\"Facebook\",\"link\":\"https://www.facebook.com/toshimaya.co.jp\",\"_id\":\"696efc61f47886b172bac7cc\"},{\"name\":\"Instagram\",\"link\":\"https://www.instagram.com/toshimaya_honten/\",\"_id\":\"696efc61f47886b172bac7cd\"}],\"brands\":[\"679341ddc3b340b981aed816\"],\"createdAt\":\"2025-01-24T07:31:41.206Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-01-20T03:54:09.636Z\",\"__v\":0,\"slug\":\"toshimaya-corporation\",\"fax\":\"+81332939117\",\"foundation_year\":1596},\"category\":{\"_id\":\"6a05ee91c3b09561c7cda9f3\",\"name\":\"San_daniele\",\"description\":\"SD\",\"force\":0},\"session\":{\"_id\":\"69c3105358fb8780cb37ec34\",\"name\":\"Food Pairing\",\"product_type\":\"Food Pairing\"},\"section\":\"\",\"number\":993,\"status\":\"approved\",\"is_completed\":\"2026-06-23T12:09:44.040Z\",\"is_present\":null,\"was_qr_code_downloaded\":false,\"is_design_bonus\":false,\"current_judges\":[],\"current_votes\":8,\"max_votes\":8,\"medals\":[],\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-22T14:55:42.835Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-23T12:09:44.034Z\",\"__v\":8,\"table\":{\"_id\":\"6a3a2a110895113beaed36bc\",\"competition\":\"69394e2c7ad96d9433c9a373\",\"name\":\"JUN\",\"bottle_capacity\":300,\"judge_capacity\":150,\"current_judges\":0,\"__v\":0}},{\"extra_competition_data\":{\"finishing\":[],\"no_sale_price\":false,\"price_not_disclosed\":false,\"has_no_jan_code\":false,\"jan_code_not_reveal\":false,\"special_production_method\":[],\"sake_koji\":[],\"first_moromi\":[],\"main_ingredients\":[]